  "bodyHash": "6cbffda55fe6f18a",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">✨为你的我的世界世界增添一些兔兔的快乐 🐰</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>自定义设计的兔子纹理，为你的游戏体验增添一丝特别。<br></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">纹理会随季节自动变化！（可关闭）</span><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sapling\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌱 必须安装 Sapling mod 才能使此模组正常工作&nbsp;🌱<br></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚙️此模组需要在客户端和服务器上都安装，这样你才能和朋友看到相同的纹理 🤗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>✨全新的 26.1（及更高版本）模型现已可用！✨</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1632/974/rabbit-front-banner-new-13-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1613/575/26.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><br></em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>✨当然，我们不能忘记经典模型！✨<br></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>适用于 Minecraft 1.20.1、1.21.1 和 1.21.11</em></span><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1632/975/classic-rabbit-banners-16-png.png\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1632/976/classic-rabbit-banners-17-png.png\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>兔子变体在世界中随机生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">重新打开世界时，兔子会保留其原有的皮肤。收集所有变体吧！🤗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸☀️🍂❄️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">纹理将根据季节自动变化。普通兔子也会继续存在。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">季节日期：日 - 月</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸春季：01-03 / 31-05 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ☀️夏季：01-06 / 31-08</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🍂秋季：01-09 / 30-11 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ❄️冬季：01-12 / 28-02 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">还增加了一个命令来选择你偏好的半球！北半球或南半球 😊</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（默认自动选择北半球）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">‼️🏷️如果你希望某个特定兔子全年保持某种特定的纹理，请确保在新季节开始之前</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">给它起个名字！否则它们将会改变。‼️🏷️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>命令<br></strong><em>⚙️</em><em>用于自定义你的体验。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>管理员工具</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> adminTools flipSeasonDatesToOtherHemisphere&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>| 切换半球</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> adminTools resetAllLoadedEntityTextures&nbsp;&nbsp; |&nbsp; <em>重置游戏中已加载的兔子纹理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> adminTools reloadConfigFile | <em>重新加载配置文件中的更改</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>配置值</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> setConfigValues showCurrentValues</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> setConfigValues disableSeasonsDuringHoliday (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>禁用节日与季节纹理混合的选项。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> setConfigValues nameTagPreventsTexture (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>通过名牌保存纹理或禁用该功能的选项。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> /maplemods rabbit setConfigValues replaceSeasonalTextures &nbsp;|<em> 在做出更改后重新加载纹理。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新分类设置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> updateCategorySettings _default&nbsp;&nbsp; | <em>禁用或启用原版兔子纹理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> updateCategorySettings <em>&lt;category&gt;</em> (disable/enable/setDate)&nbsp; | <em>自定义季节</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新纹理设置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">rabbit</span> updateTextureSettings <em>&lt;texture&gt;</em> (disable/enable) | <em>专门选择启用或禁用哪些纹理</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">非常兴奋终于能设计并发布我的自定义兔子了。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✨ 希望你看到它们蹦蹦跳跳时和我创作它们时一样开心 ✨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">季节纹理也可用于以下生物：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-bee-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜜蜂！🐝</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-chicken-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸡！🐥</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-creeper-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">苦力怕！💚</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-frog-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">青蛙！🐸</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-parrot-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鹦鹉！🦜</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-pig-collection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">猪！🐷</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">更多生物即将推出！</span></p>",
